{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98622","id":2149966138,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6AJeE6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98622","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98622.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98622.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98622","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98622/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98622/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98622/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/565d2cc36e0fa52691ae890af8210d8baf611627","number":98622,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Generate build status-dependent icons for the editor","user":{"login":"tehKaiN","id":16180344,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTgwMzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16180344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN","html_url":"https://github.com/tehKaiN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/541\r\n\r\nAlso auto-generates the icons for console executables under Windows. They are not pixel-exact to the previous ones, since they're composited dynamically, but they should be close enough.\r\n\r\nSample preview using some kind of web-based .ico previewer - might be a bit distorted.\r\n\r\n![main_full](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/871c480d-9af1-42ef-86bc-71e32952aa74)\r\n![main_full](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9185d65-a890-446d-b73e-08be3ccd1c92)\r\n\r\nCaveats:\r\n- Icon components are rendered to PNG first, then composited, because doing everything in SVG and then converting to PNG yielded bad results - some lines were thinner than others, also getting color-mixed with the neighbors.\r\n- I'm mainly a programmer, so SVGs present in the PR are not perfect - though I assume they are good enough placeholders. I've concocted them in GodSVG in conjunction with some kind of web-based SVG text path generator.\r\n- No linux icons because I couldn't get any response on how to tackle it in the proposal issue. :(\r\n\r\nAlso it made a bit of make_icons.sh obsolete, so perhaps it could supersede it further? I don't know how it's called though - make_icons.py is intended to generate files which are to be commited, whereas it looks like make_icons.sh is used for packaging?","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.